{"seq":2,"slug":"computational-science","title":"计算科学前沿","stage":"DONE","chapterCount":3,"docCount":9,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/phd/natural-sciences/computational-science","introMarkdown":"# 计算科学前沿 简介\n\n计算科学是与理论和实验并列的\"第三根科学支柱\"，通过数学建模、数值算法和高性能计算探索传统方法无法触及的科学问题。从气候模拟到蛋白质折叠，从宇宙演化到新材料设计，计算科学正在重塑几乎所有自然科学学科的研究范式。博士阶段的计算科学研究者不仅需要掌握特定领域的物理模型，更需要理解支撑这些模型的计算基础设施、算法创新和跨尺度方法论。\n\n本专题围绕计算科学的三个核心前沿展开，覆盖从硬件到算法再到方法论的完整谱系。\n\n第一章**高性能计算**聚焦计算基础设施层面。从并行计算范式（MPI、OpenMP、GPU 编程）到异构架构（CPU-GPU 协同、FPGA 加速），再到性能工程的系统方法论——如何让代码在现代硬件上真正\"快起来\"是每一位计算科学家的必修课。\n\n第二章**科学机器学习**探讨深度学习与物理建模的融合。物理信息神经网络（PINN）如何将守恒律嵌入损失函数，神经算子（DeepONet、Fourier Neural Operator）如何学习算子映射以替代昂贵的数值求解，以及数据驱动发现如何从观测数据中自动推导控制方程——这些方法正在模糊机器学习与计算物理的边界。\n\n第三章**多尺度建模**处理跨时间和空间尺度的科学问题。从量子力学到连续介质力学，不同尺度的物理定律各不相同，多尺度方法通过层级耦合、自适应选择和粗粒化策略将它们统一在一个计算框架中。本章还涉及不确定性量化——当模型参数和输入数据存在不确定性时，如何可靠地评估预测的置信度。\n\n建议按章节顺序学习：高性能计算提供算力基础，科学机器学习提供新的算法工具，多尺度建模提供系统方法论。三者结合代表了当代计算科学的核心能力要求。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"high-performance-computing","title":"高性能计算","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/phd/natural-sciences/computational-science/high-performance-computing","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"parallel-computing-paradigms","title":"博士阶段 计算科学前沿 — 并行计算范式与编程模型","url":"/l-doc-books/education/phd/natural-sciences/computational-science/high-performance-computing/parallel-computing-paradigms"},{"seq":2,"slug":"heterogeneous-computing-architectures","title":"博士阶段 计算科学前沿 — 异构计算与加速器架构","url":"/l-doc-books/education/phd/natural-sciences/computational-science/high-performance-computing/heterogeneous-computing-architectures"},{"seq":3,"slug":"performance-engineering","title":"博士阶段 计算科学前沿 — 性能工程与优化方法论","url":"/l-doc-books/education/phd/natural-sciences/computational-science/high-performance-computing/performance-engineering"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"scientific-machine-learning","title":"科学机器学习","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/phd/natural-sciences/computational-science/scientific-machine-learning","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"physics-informed-neural-networks","title":"博士阶段 计算科学前沿 — 物理信息神经网络","url":"/l-doc-books/education/phd/natural-sciences/computational-science/scientific-machine-learning/physics-informed-neural-networks"},{"seq":2,"slug":"neural-operators-and-surrogate-models","title":"博士阶段 计算科学前沿 — 神经算子与代理模型","url":"/l-doc-books/education/phd/natural-sciences/computational-science/scientific-machine-learning/neural-operators-and-surrogate-models"},{"seq":3,"slug":"data-driven-physical-discovery","title":"博士阶段 计算科学前沿 — 数据驱动的物理发现","url":"/l-doc-books/education/phd/natural-sciences/computational-science/scientific-machine-learning/data-driven-physical-discovery"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"multiscale-modeling","title":"多尺度建模","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/phd/natural-sciences/computational-science/multiscale-modeling","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"hierarchical-methods-and-scale-bridging","title":"博士阶段 计算科学前沿 — 层级方法与尺度桥接","url":"/l-doc-books/education/phd/natural-sciences/computational-science/multiscale-modeling/hierarchical-methods-and-scale-bridging"},{"seq":2,"slug":"adaptive-and-coarse-graining-techniques","title":"博士阶段 计算科学前沿 — 自适应与粗粒化技术","url":"/l-doc-books/education/phd/natural-sciences/computational-science/multiscale-modeling/adaptive-and-coarse-graining-techniques"},{"seq":3,"slug":"uncertainty-quantification-and-reliability","title":"博士阶段 计算科学前沿 — 不确定性量化与可靠性","url":"/l-doc-books/education/phd/natural-sciences/computational-science/multiscale-modeling/uncertainty-quantification-and-reliability"}]}]}